FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Woh ho ho !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} On dirait que tu as fait
d'énormes progrès à la pêche.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Je suis ravi de te voir si {{TAG:000E:0006:0E00E900700061006E006F00750069001000E900700061006E006F00750069006500}}
et en communion avec la nature !

{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Woh ho ho !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} On dirait que tu es
devenu{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006500}} une vraie célébrité des
excursions dans les îles !{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Tu t'es fait un nom de part et
d'autre de la grande bleue{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Je suis si fier de toi !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Arrrk ark ark!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} It seems like you
have a pretty healthy love for
all things pertaining to gardening.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Your beautiful heart treasures
the town's lovely environment{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}This old man really respects that!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Uah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Sembra che ti sia dat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
parecchio da fare per estirpare
le erbacce che infestano la città!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Spero che continuerai così
per tenere quelle brutte piante
infestanti lontane dalla città!

{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Uah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Direi che sei diventat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
proprio brav{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a strappare
le erbacce qui in città.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Complimenti per il tuo impegno
a favore dell'ambiente, tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Arrrk ark ark!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} It seems you've
heard the old saying that a Bell
saved is a Bell earned.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}You have it all together, youngster.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I like how you're preparing now for
your future!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Uah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Conosci l'adagio: "stellina
risparmiata, stellina guadagnata"?
Beh, tu lo segui proprio alla lettera!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Mi piace come la pensi, tigrott{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
La mentalità da formica alla lunga
ripaga più di quella da cicala!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ark ark ark!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} 'Biriktirilen Bell,
kazanılan Bell'dir' sözünü
duymuşsun.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}İşini biliyorsun genç dostum.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Geleceğin için şimdiden hazırlanmanı beğendim!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Errrk erk erk!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Da hast du ja einen
ganz schönen Batzen an Sternis
zusammengespart!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Es ist eine Wonne, dir zuzusehen,
wie du Sterni für Sterni sparst...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ich ziehe meinen Hut vor dir!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Uah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Sembra che ormai
tu sia diventat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} un{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006100}} cliente fiss{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
di {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Merino{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Che piacere sapere che l'arte
dell'arredamento personalizzato
ha fatto breccia nel tuo cuore!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Woh ho ho !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} On dirait que
l'{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Académie des joyeux décorateurs{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
t'a donné une bonne note.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Je serais vraiment heureux si tu
