{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Tu as vraiment piqué ma curiosité !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Uah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Sembra quasi che tu
non riesca a vivere senza assistere
agli show di {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}K.K. {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ogni settimana!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Guarda che non è un rimprovero{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
