EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Arrrk ark ark!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} It seems you've had
an incredible number of dreams up
until now. Truly remarkable!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}But I don't want you to just dream.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I want you to share your wonderful
dreams with other people too!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Jar, jar, jar!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Es increíble que se
pueda tener tal cantidad de sueños,
¡y tan dispares!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Pero no te limites solo a soñar.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
En este mundo se puede compartir
cualquier cosa, ¡incluso los sueños!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Uah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Sembra proprio che
tu abbia fatto una montagna
di sogni. Davvero ammirevole!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ma non sognare e basta!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Dammi retta, condividi i tuoi
splendidi sogni anche con gli altri!
